            "review_title": "Review at Com Nha Anh",
            "review_text": "Fook L\nSingapore, Singapore62 contributions\n0\nFrom the Corner, hide a great restaurant!!\nJun 2025 • Friends\nWe went on a local tour and our tour guide suggested Com Nha Anh for authentic, delicious and value for money lunch location. I am glad we went with his recommendation. The environment is clean, simple yet cosy. Services were prompt and efficient. The food options were plentiful and it tastes great. A good venue for a simple, yet delightful meals.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 23, 2025",
